# Playwright & TypeScript Testing Rules

1. **Clean POM:** All selectors in Page Classes (`pages/`). Test scripts only call Page Class methods.
2. **Dynamic Smart Waits:** Use web-first assertions (`expect(locator).toBeVisible()`) and bounded explicit event waits (`waitForURL`, `waitForResponse`). Zero `waitForTimeout`.
3. **Idempotent Data:** Generate dynamic test data (`AUTO_` + Date.now()). Clean up in `afterEach`/`afterAll`.
